1
00:00:00,604 --> 00:00:06,884
Welcome to Zenith, a personalized learning platform designed to make your academic journey clear, active, and supported.

2
00:00:08,782 --> 00:00:10,570
Zenith is built on three pillars.

3
00:00:11,487 --> 00:00:13,017
First, Absolute Clarity:

4
00:00:14,003 --> 00:00:17,193
always know what to do, where to find it, and what comes next.

5
00:00:18,138 --> 00:00:20,448
Second, Active Engagement and Motivation:

6
00:00:21,410 --> 00:00:25,404
your work is checked, your progress is recognized, and you learn at your own pace.

7
00:00:26,321 --> 00:00:29,061
Third, Advice, Direction, and Community:

8
00:00:30,004 --> 00:00:33,446
receive personalized guidance and support without unhealthy competition.

9
00:00:36,817 --> 00:00:40,409
The Resources page provides recommended SAT and AP materials,

10
00:00:40,655 --> 00:00:43,602
including public self-study tracks that anyone can use.

11
00:00:44,910 --> 00:00:47,708
Students can log in to access their personalized portal.

12
00:00:48,752 --> 00:00:52,902
Select a course here, or return whenever you need to switch subjects.

13
00:00:59,324 --> 00:01:01,712
The Roadmap displays your complete learning path.

14
00:01:02,709 --> 00:01:07,646
Each item shows what is complete, available, recommended for review, or still locked.

15
00:01:08,612 --> 00:01:11,098
You can also choose the roadmap view

16
00:01:12,103 --> 00:01:14,918
that works best for you.

17
00:01:18,031 --> 00:01:22,921
The Now page shows the most important task you should work on next.

18
00:01:24,859 --> 00:01:26,974
Feedback explains how you can improve,

19
00:01:27,252 --> 00:01:32,212
while your personalized Cheat Sheet preserves important concepts and lessons from previous work.

20
00:01:34,701 --> 00:01:36,801
Use Calendar to check upcoming dates,

21
00:01:37,044 --> 00:01:40,273
and Submit to turn in your work and confirm that it was received.

22
00:01:44,215 --> 00:01:47,787
With Zenith, the process is clear, your potential is limitless.

23
00:01:48,739 --> 00:01:49,556
Let’s get to work.
